OL,3,GNEWSA'Under siege' bus service halted
OL,4,Aafter four attacks in two hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus company has warned it may
OL,7,Fwithdraw services from part of North
OL,8,FLanarkshire after a spate of attacks on
OL,9,Fits vehicles.
OL,11,FFirst Bus removed the 240 service from
OL,12,Ftravelling through Viewpark, near
OL,13,FBellshill, on Friday night after four
OL,14,Fof its vehicles were pelted with
OL,15,Fmissiles in a two-hour period.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
