OL,3,GNEWSA'Under siege' bus service halted
OL,4,Aafter four attacks in two hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Helen Loughran said the
OL,7,Fservice, which runs between Glasgow
OL,8,Fcity centre and Overtown near Wishaw,
OL,9,Fhad been "under siege" and suggested
OL,10,Fthat young people were behind the
OL,11,Fattacks - but First Bus told the BBC it
OL,12,Fcould not verify this.
OL,14,FIn a letter to local politicians, the
OL,15,Fcompany said it could not keep sending
OL,16,Fbuses into Viewpark and risking the
OL,17,Fsafety of drivers and passengers.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
